      * RPG III: ALTSEQ, file translation, transparent literals (RV-33)
      * H: column 26 S, 43 F, 57 1. Tables are at the end of the source:
      * file translation, then ALTSEQ records, then compile-time arrays.
     H                   S                F             1
     FCUSTMAS IF  F      80            DISK
     FORDERS  UF  F      80            DISK
     E                    TAB     3   3  4
     ICUSTMAS AA
     I                                        1   6 NAME
      * Transparent literal: double-byte data between shift-out and shift-in
      * characters: the compiler scans literals when column 57 of H is 1
